{"case_id":"T8008","gap_exists":true,"gap_type":["input_semantics","format_specific_seed_corpus","attack_surface"],"confidence":98,"affected_functions":["archive_read_support_format_lha","archive_read_format_lha_bid","archive_read_format_lha_read_header","lha_read_file_header_0","lha_read_file_header_1","lha_read_file_header_2","lha_read_file_header_3","lha_read_file_extended_header","archive_read_format_lha_read_data","lha_read_data_lzh","lzh_decode"],"reason":"H0 enables the new LHA reader indirectly through archive_read_support_format_all and exercises header/data iteration, but its files[] corpus contains no LHA archive. Mutating less than 1% of ISO, tar, ZIP, cpio, mtree, ar, and compressed examples is not an effective way to produce the rigid LHA signatures and internally consistent sizes/checksums needed to reach the new 2,340-line header parser and LZH decoder. Consequently, important LHA-specific states receive materially inadequate fuzz coverage.","evidence":["archive_read_support_format_all now calls archive_read_support_format_lha, so the registration entry point is enabled by H0.","H0 files[] contains ISO, bzip2, tar, gzip, xz, ZIP, ar, cpio, RPM, and mtree inputs, but no LHA input.","H0 preserves each seed's size and changes only numbytes = rand() % (size / 100), making construction of a recognizable LHA archive from unrelated formats highly unlikely.","archive_read_format_lha_bid requires an LHA header accepted by lha_check_header_format, or an MZ self-extracting stream containing such a header.","archive_read_format_lha_read_header dispatches distinct header levels to lha_read_file_header_0, lha_read_file_header_1, lha_read_file_header_2, and lha_read_file_header_3.","lha_read_file_extended_header parses attacker-controlled chained sizes and types including EXT_FILENAME, EXT_DIRECTORY, EXT_TIMESTAMP, EXT_FILESIZE, EXT_UNIX_MODE, and EXT_NEW_ATTR.","lha_read_data_lzh and lzh_decode add stateful bitstream and Huffman decoding for lh5, lh6, and lh7 data, which requires a recognized LHA entry before H0's archive_read_data_block loop can exercise it."],"recommended_action":"Add valid, structurally diverse LHA seeds to H0, covering header levels 0 through 3, MZ self-extracting prefixes, stored methods lh0/lz4, compressed methods lh5/lh6/lh7, chained extended headers, multiple entries, and truncated or inconsistent size/CRC variants; retain the existing archive_read_next_header and archive_read_data_block traversal."}
